# Class declaration with injective: 1 flag on the resolver metadata.
# Verifies that injective: 1 parses and type-checks without error.
# Integer encoding: 1 = injective, 0 = not injective (protocol-level, not prelude Boolean).
[
  TestClass: [class [let TestClass a b c]
    [determines: [[[a b] c]]
     resolver: TestResolver
     injective: 1]
    test: [Fn@c [a b]]]

  result: "ok"
]
---
%.result
=== out
String("ok")
